{"3744220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Craball", "steam_appid": 3744220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>lay as a  crab trying to keep a ball in the air. Move side to side, bop the ball up, and scoop up gold as they rain down upon you! The longer you keep the bounce going, the more treasure you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, meditative, replayable, and yet surprisingly difficult. Play alone or with a friend in Coop and competitive mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move left and right with the joystick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the ball bouncing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins for extra points</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a bounce? It’s game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦀 Simple joystick controls: just move left or right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏐 Ball physics: keep it bouncing as long as you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Coin collection and score chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 Easy to pick up and play</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 For Players Who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like casual reflex games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult games</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>lay as a  crab trying to keep a ball in the air. Move side to side, bop the ball up, and scoop up gold as they rain down upon you! The longer you keep the bounce going, the more treasure you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, meditative, replayable, and yet surprisingly difficult. Play alone or with a friend in Coop and competitive mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move left and right w